[{:db/id 17592186138543 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-cb0ebb6a-03fa-5b1b-8654-264dc64bb29c" "question-6b401926-c0e5-5474-b55e-50619c2b3ed1" "question-249f6b82-58fe-57e4-9615-124e3e5d81ba" "question-9aec8641-cb39-5884-b6b8-490e04a0b718" "question-0fa21caf-246b-5d76-968d-b7297759b1d6"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186138080 :question/problem "What is the value of $\\mid 4\\!\\mid \\,?$" :question/worked-solution "The absolute value of a positive number equals the number:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\\mid 4\\!\\mid \\, =4\t\n\t}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of a number gives the distance between the number and zero on a number line.\n\n![](images/4d/4dc8f8174b1a226b3cfeaedc9e909adce1171c9daca1833d80ca09b286115755.png)" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186138544 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-36a54bb6-398d-5b72-b8d0-6330c32d47d3" "question-92383c72-78eb-58ae-9945-4a084c79c027" "question-e932892a-5787-5434-bad5-4e36c81ade48" "question-5945d93c-a70a-521a-869b-73c5d038b545" "question-e075e7f6-4314-5355-a54b-c2744dd179fe"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186138081 :question/problem "Find $| {-2} |.$" :question/worked-solution "To find the absolute value of $-2,$ we simply drop the negative sign:\n\n$$\n\\mid-2\\!\\mid=2\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of a number gives the distance between the number and zero on a number line.\n\n![](images/79/79429acd5f23eaca53c510a515096e419cbbf1f685868bfaa1bc8ee41498adce.png)" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186138545 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-20a05891-4447-51b2-931e-a4b3934df34d" "question-9184b1c1-18a5-54d0-ad44-5eac57556d33" "question-0c9c7663-aff3-5fde-bcfd-2f3d35466cd0" "question-fff0b120-db96-5dff-b40b-797e75c347f8"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186138082 :question/problem "The point shown below represents a number on a number line. The absolute value of this number is $4.$ What is the number?\n\n![](images/0e/0e8aaf68af47ecf3eadbd492af662273a68400bed20d3a5b214ec118abb6a2df.png)" :question/worked-solution "The number is *negative* because it is to the *left* of zero.\n\nThe absolute value of the number is $4,$ so the distance between that number and zero on a number line is $4.$ \n\nThe negative number at a distance of $4$ from zero is $-4,$ so the number is $-4.$\n\n![](images/b0/b0d99997e27059b23342de79fc887c85b56991e1312f430f80fcf39311479ad2.png)" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-cb0ebb6a-03fa-5b1b-8654-264dc64bb29c" :question/id #uuid "cb0ebb6a-03fa-5b1b-8654-264dc64bb29c" :question/math-academy-id "q-93360" :question/problem "$∣11\\,∣=$" :question/worked-solution "The absolute value of a positive number equals the number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∣11\\,∣\\,=11\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of a number gives the distance between the number and zero on a number line.\n\n![](images/56/5610f625d0940b74908035913bd5294b66622761fa3da61acd99d687c7b292de.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a769b84f-1f06-535f-ad94-2d1b1cfec08c"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a769b84f-1f06-535f-ad94-2d1b1cfec08c" :answer-field/id #uuid "a769b84f-1f06-535f-ad94-2d1b1cfec08c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c324e07d-6f0f-5822-8095-69bf0b3bc892" :answer-field/choices ["answer-97ee6254-df4b-5bbb-84a1-38dec329f408" "answer-57a2411f-7ec2-5553-9e92-0adfb376dff1" "answer-4b64d8d8-0834-559b-b11c-355de5f66927" "answer-c324e07d-6f0f-5822-8095-69bf0b3bc892" "answer-3b5b4a43-b78b-5c85-840d-445172dacc80"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-97ee6254-df4b-5bbb-84a1-38dec329f408" :answer/id #uuid "97ee6254-df4b-5bbb-84a1-38dec329f408" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-57a2411f-7ec2-5553-9e92-0adfb376dff1" :answer/id #uuid "57a2411f-7ec2-5553-9e92-0adfb376dff1" :answer/ty