 number line. The absolute value of this number is $\\frac{21}{4}.$ What is the number?" :question/worked-solution "The number is *positive* because it is to the *right* of zero.\n\nThe absolute value of the number is $\\frac{21}{4},$ so the distance between that number and zero on a number line is $\\frac{21}{4}.$ \n\nThe positive number at a distance of $\\frac{21}{4}$ from zero is $\\frac{21}{4}.$\n\n![](images/6c/6c86e406964238ba196b7f79ef731a618efb46748d9d22b79ff27dba2cf0069b.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b51e9cee-8316-54d2-839d-e8e2a267b6ba"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b51e9cee-8316-54d2-839d-e8e2a267b6ba" :answer-field/id #uuid "b51e9cee-8316-54d2-839d-e8e2a267b6ba" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-835a9982-27c5-58cc-aaaa-b3a6f26b4008" :answer-field/choices ["answer-451fe032-8a17-5e4d-aa1d-1e8b81c95852" "answer-cd0abfa1-fbe2-594f-aa02-ac3d60108fa7" "answer-86566f39-0eb4-5569-97b5-0dae7b8bf7b8" "answer-ae5f9ad3-a3dc-5a19-8879-355d0bf6761d" "answer-835a9982-27c5-58cc-aaaa-b3a6f26b4008"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-451fe032-8a17-5e4d-aa1d-1e8b81c95852" :answer/id #uuid "451fe032-8a17-5e4d-aa1d-1e8b81c95852" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cd0abfa1-fbe2-594f-aa02-ac3d60108fa7" :answer/id #uuid "cd0abfa1-fbe2-594f-aa02-ac3d60108fa7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{21}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-86566f39-0eb4-5569-97b5-0dae7b8bf7b8" :answer/id #uuid "86566f39-0eb4-5569-97b5-0dae7b8bf7b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ae5f9ad3-a3dc-5a19-8879-355d0bf6761d" :answer/id #uuid "ae5f9ad3-a3dc-5a19-8879-355d0bf6761d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-835a9